                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nAre rainbows devoid of color?\n\nNo, they have all the colors.\n\nSo, what are rainbows made of?\n\nRainbows are made of light mixed together.\n\nWhat kind of light?\n\nSunlight.\n\nWhat is sunlight made of?\n\nSunlight is made of all the colors mixed together.\n\nSo, what are rainbows made of?\n\nRainbows are made of sunlight.\n\nWhat are the colors of sunlight?\n\nThe colors of sunlight are red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet.\n\nSo, what are the colors of rainbows?\n\nThe colors of rainbows are red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet.\n\nSo, what are the yin and yang colors?\n\nThe yin and yang colors are red and green.\n\nAre rainbows made of mixing yin and yang colors?\n\nNo, rainbows are made of all the colors mixed together.",
