                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Question: Do the owners of the company where Peter Griffin is employed require barley?\nA) True\nB) False\n\nTo answer this question, we need to consider the following steps:\n\n1. Identify the company Peter Griffin works for.\n2. Determine the nature of the company's business.\n3. Assess whether barley is relevant to the company's operations.\n\nStep 1: Peter Griffin is a fictional character from the animated television series \"Family Guy.\" He works at the Pawtucket Brewery.\n\nStep 2: Pawtucket Brewery is a beer manufacturing company.\n\nStep 3: Barley is a primary ingredient in the beer-making process. Therefore, it is relevant to the company's operations.\n\nBased on the above reasoning, the answer is:\n\nA) True",
