                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To answer this question, we need to consider the following:\n\n1. What company does Peter Griffin work for?\n2. What is the nature of the company's business?\n3. Does the company's business require the use of barley?\n\nPeter Griffin is a fictional character from the animated television series Family Guy. He works for the Pawtucket Brewery, a beer manufacturing company.\n\nSince the company is a brewery, it is involved in the production of beer. Barley is a key ingredient in the beer-making process, as it is the source of malt, which provides fermentable sugars for the yeast to convert into alcohol.\n\nTherefore, the owners of the company Peter Griffin works for would need barley.\n\nAnswer: A) True",
                        "answers": [
