                        "cot": "\n\nCerebral palsy is a neurological disorder that affects muscle movement and coordination. It is caused by damage to the brain before, during, or after birth. There is no cure for cerebral palsy, but there are treatments that can help improve a person's quality of life.\n\nThere is no known cause of cerebral palsy, so it is impossible to say whether or not a young Wizard of Oz Scarecrow could have gotten the condition.",
