                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nA light year is the distance light travels in one year. This is equivalent to 9.5 trillion kilometers or 5.9 trillion miles.\n\nTo answer the question, we can eliminate C and D as they are not related to the distance light travels in one year.\n\nA) the distance light travels in one year.\nB) the of time it takes light to travel from Earth to the Sun.\n\nThe answer is A) the distance light travels in one year. It takes 8 minutes and 20 seconds for light to travel from the Sun to Earth, but this is not related to a light year.",
