                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Identify the cause of the differences in water level at the beach.\n2. Determine which of the given options has a gravitational influence on the Earth.\n3. Choose the option that matches the cause of the differences in water level.\n\nAnswer:\n1. The differences in water level at the beach are due to the gravitational influence of an external body on the Earth's water bodies.\n2. The Sun, Moon, asteroids, and comets all have a gravitational influence on the Earth.\n3. The Moon has the strongest gravitational influence on the Earth's water bodies, causing the tides to rise and fall. Therefore, the correct answer is B) the Moon.",
