                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Understand the definition of each of the four options.\n\nOption A: Cooling temperatures\nOption B: High pressure and heat\nOption C: Weathering and erosion\nOption D: Compacted plant remains\n\nStep 2: Research the rock cycle and how igneous rocks form.\n\nStep 3: Compare the research to the four options.\n\nOption A: Cooling temperatures - This is not how igneous rocks form.\nOption B: High pressure and heat - This is how igneous rocks form.\nOption C: Weathering and erosion - This is not how igneous rocks form.\nOption D: Compacted plant remains - This is not how igneous rocks form.\n\nAnswer: B) High pressure and heat",
                        "answers": [
