                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Understand the question and the process of sedimentary rock formation.\n2. Identify the options and eliminate the ones that do not fit the process.\n3. Choose the option that follows the process of sedimentary rock formation after sediment deposition.\n\nAnswer:\n1. Sedimentary rocks are formed from the accumulation and lithification of sedimentary materials such as sand, mud, and organic matter.\n2. After sediment deposition, the next step in the formation of sedimentary rocks is burial. The weight of the overlying sediment compacts the lower layers, squeezing out water and air, and cementing the sediment particles together.\n3. Therefore, the correct answer is B) burying.",
