                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What happens to cold air at the tops of mountains?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n- Cold air is denser than warm air, so it tends to sink.\n- Mountains are high elevations, so the air at the tops of mountains is colder than the air at lower elevations.\n- Therefore, the cold air at the tops of mountains will tend to sink and flow downhill toward areas of lower elevation.\n- This downhill flow will create areas of higher pressure in valleys.\n- Therefore, the answer is A) will flow toward areas of lower pressure in valleys.\n\nAnswer: A) will flow toward areas of lower pressure in valleys.",
