                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nRe-phrased question: Which of the following weather events is most likely to cause a forest fire?\nA) a flash flood\nB) a lightning strike\nC) a tornado\nD) a hailstorm\n\nStep 1: A flash flood is unlikely to cause a forest fire because it is a large amount of water that would put out any fire.\n\nStep 2: A tornado is unlikely to cause a forest fire because it is a powerful wind that would also put out any fire.\n\nStep 3: A hailstorm is unlikely to cause a forest fire because it is a form of precipitation that would also put out any fire.\n\nStep 4: A lightning strike is the most likely weather event to cause a forest fire because lightning is a form of electricity that can cause a spark that can ignite a fire.\n\nAnswer: B) a lightning strike",
