                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the properties of sound waves.\n- Frequency determines the pitch of the sound.\n- Amplitude determines the loudness of the sound.\n- Wavelength is the distance between two consecutive points in the same phase of the wave.\n- Speed in air is the speed at which the sound wave travels through the air.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the given information.\n- Both sound waves have the same pitch, so their frequencies are the same.\n- The second sound wave is louder, which means it has a higher amplitude.\n\nStep 3: Determine the correct answer.\nSince the second sound wave is louder, its amplitude is greater. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\nB) Amplitude",
