                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe correct answer is B.\n\nSound waves are longitudinal waves, which means that they have a wavelength. The wavelength of a sound wave is the distance between two adjacent crests of the wave. The amplitude of a sound wave is the height of the wave. The amplitude of a sound wave is related to the loudness of the sound. The second sound wave is louder, so it has a greater amplitude.\nThe answer is B.",
