                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: I'm not sure which option is the best conclusion about Polar Snooze sleeping bags based on the advertisement. Can you help me work it out?\n\nProfessor: Of course! Let's go through each option and see if it's supported by the information in the advertisement. First, option A says that the sleeping bags are lightweight. Does the advertisement mention anything about the weight of the sleeping bags?\n\nStudent: No, it doesn't.\n\nProfessor: That's correct. So we can eliminate option A. Now, let's look at option B, which says that the sleeping bags have insulation. Does the advertisement mention anything about insulation?\n\nStudent: Yes, it says that the sleeping bags are double-thermal, which I think means they have insulation.\n\nProfessor: Exactly! Double-thermal implies that the sleeping bags have insulation to keep you warm during winter camping. So option B is a possible answer. Let's check the other options to make sure we have the best conclusion. Option C says that the sleeping bags make winter camping easy. Does the advertisement mention anything about making camping easier?\n\nStudent: No, it only says that the sleeping bags will keep you warm.\n\nProfessor: Correct. So we can eliminate option C. Finally, option D says that the sleeping bags cost less than other sleeping bags. Does the advertisement mention anything about the price?\n\nStudent: No, it doesn't.\n\nProfessor: That's right. So we can eliminate option D as well. Now, which option is the best conclusion based on the information in the advertisement?\n\nStudent: Option B, that the Polar Snooze sleeping bags have insulation.\n\nProfessor: Exactly! Well done.",
                        "answers": [
