                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question to ensure we understand it correctly: What is one of the roles of the human body's digestive system?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step by spelling out our thoughts and reasoning:\n\nA) Carrying oxygen to the lungs - This is a function of the respiratory system, not the digestive system.\n\nB) Sending signals from the brain to the spinal cord - This is a function of the nervous system, not the digestive system.\n\nC) Breaking down food into nutrients - This seems like a function of the digestive system, as it is responsible for breaking down food and absorbing nutrients.\n\nD) Providing support for the body - This is a function of the skeletal system, not the digestive system.\n\nAfter evaluating each option, we can conclude that the correct answer is:\n\nC) Breaking down food into nutrients, as this is a function of the digestive system in the human body.",
