                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What part of a plant contains the most of the special parts that capture sunlight and use it to make food?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- The question is asking about the parts of a plant that capture sunlight and make food.\n- We know that these parts are called chloroplasts.\n- Chloroplasts are found in plant cells.\n- Therefore, we need to identify the part of the plant that contains the most plant cells with chloroplasts.\n\nAnswer: C) leaves. Leaves contain the most chloroplasts in a plant, making them the part of the plant where you will find the most of the special parts that capture sunlight and use it to make food.",
