                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Understand the question.\nThe question is asking where in a plant will you find the most of the parts that capture sunlight and use it to make food. \n\nStep 2: Research the parts of a plant.\nResearch the different parts of a plant and what they are used for. \n\nStep 3: Analyze the answer choices.\nAnalyze the answer choices and determine which one is most likely to contain the parts that capture sunlight and use it to make food. \n\nAnswer: C) Leaves",
