                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Identify the question: How do people get energy and nutrients?\n2. List possible answers: A) breathing clean air, B) exercising and playing, C) getting plenty of rest, D) eating healthy food.\n3. Evaluate each answer option:\n- A) Breathing clean air: While clean air is important for overall health, it does not provide energy or nutrients.\n- B) Exercising and playing: While exercise and play are important for overall health, they do not provide all the necessary nutrients and energy.\n- C) Getting plenty of rest: While rest is important for overall health, it does not provide energy or nutrients.\n- D) Eating healthy food: This is the correct answer. Eating healthy food provides the necessary nutrients and energy for the body to function properly.\n4. Choose the correct answer: D) Eating healthy food.\n\nAnswer: People get energy and nutrients by eating healthy food.",
