                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Question: What are the ways in which people obtain energy and nutrients?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n- Energy and nutrients are essential for the human body to function properly.\n- Breathing clean air, exercising and playing, and getting plenty of rest are important for overall health, but they do not directly provide energy and nutrients.\n- Eating healthy food is the primary way in which people obtain energy and nutrients.\n- Healthy food includes a variety of fruits, vegetables, whole grains, lean proteins, and healthy fats that provide the body with the necessary vitamins, minerals, and macronutrients to function properly.\n\nAnswer: D) Eating healthy food is the main way in which people obtain energy and nutrients.",
                        "answers": [
