                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question - The question is asking how people obtain energy and nutrients, which are essential for the body to function properly.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the answer choices - We have four options to choose from:\n\nA) Breathing clean air - While breathing clean air is important for overall health, it does not provide energy and nutrients directly to the body.\n\nB) Exercising and playing - These activities help maintain a healthy body, but they do not provide energy and nutrients directly. In fact, they consume energy.\n\nC) Getting plenty of rest - Rest is essential for the body to recover and function properly, but it does not provide energy and nutrients directly.\n\nD) Eating healthy food - This option seems to be the most relevant to the question, as food is the primary source of energy and nutrients for the body.\n\nStep 3: Choose the best answer - Based on the analysis of the answer choices, the best answer is:\n\nD) Eating healthy food",
