                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Question: What is the method through which individuals obtain energy and essential nutrients?\nOptions:\nA) Inhaling pure air\nB) Engaging in physical activities and games\nC) Ensuring adequate rest\nD) Consuming nutritious food\n\nStep 1: Understanding the question\nThe question is asking us to identify the primary way in which people acquire energy and nutrients necessary for their body's functioning.\n\nStep 2: Analyzing the options\nA) Breathing clean air is essential for overall health, but it does not directly provide energy or nutrients.\nB) Exercising and playing are important for maintaining physical fitness and overall health, but they do not directly supply energy or nutrients. In fact, they consume energy.\nC) Getting plenty of rest is crucial for the body's recovery and overall well-being, but it does not directly provide energy or nutrients.\nD) Eating healthy food is the primary source of energy and nutrients for the body. Nutritious food contains essential macronutrients (carbohydrates, proteins, and fats) and micronutrients (vitamins and minerals) that the body needs to function properly.\n\nStep 3: Identifying the correct answer\nThe correct answer is D) eating healthy food, as it is the primary way through which people obtain energy and essential nutrients for their body's functioning.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "3a66531e-f186-4754-8f25-c0f748b85da4",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "D) Consuming nutritious food.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "D",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/13 08:01:51",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
