                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe best tool for Jessica to use to see the cells in an oak tree leaf is a microscope. A microscope is an instrument used to magnify objects that are too small to be seen with the naked eye. It uses lenses to magnify the object, allowing the user to see details that would otherwise be invisible. A microscope is the best tool for Jessica to use to see the cells in an oak tree leaf because it will allow her to see the individual cells in the leaf. Binoculars, reading glasses, and a magnifying glass are not powerful enough to magnify the cells in the leaf to the level of detail that a microscope can.",
