                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question - The question is asking us to identify the primary purpose of refrigerators.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the given options - We have four options to choose from: growing food, cleaning food, keeping food dry, and keeping food fresh.\n\nStep 3: Recall the purpose of refrigerators - Refrigerators were invented to maintain a low temperature for storing food, which helps in slowing down the growth of bacteria and other microorganisms, thus prolonging the freshness and shelf life of the food.\n\nStep 4: Match the purpose with the given options - The purpose of refrigerators, as mentioned in step 3, is to prolong the freshness and shelf life of the food.\n\nStep 5: Choose the correct option - Based on our analysis, the correct option is D) keeping food fresh.",
